        "projectInstructionsLoaded": [],
        "finalMessage": "I fixed both issues in `collapsible.tsx`, but couldn't re-run the linter to confirm because the command needed approval, which isn't possible in this run.\n\n**What I changed:** the clickable `div` at line 122 is now a keyboard-accessible button:\n- `role=\"button\"` fixes `no-static-element-interactions`.\n- An `onKeyDown` handler calls `openTrigger()` on Enter or Space, which fixes `click-events-have-key-events`. It also stops Space from scrolling the page, the way a real button behaves.\n- `tabIndex={0}` lets keyboard users reach the header. Without it, the new role would set off a different rule (`interactive-supports-focus`).\n- `aria-expanded={open}` tells screen readers whether the section is open or closed.\n\n**Why not use a real `<button>`:** that would normally be the cleaner fix. But the component receives its label as an `<h3>` (`label={<h3>…</h3>}`), and a heading isn't allowed inside a `<button>`. So I gave the `div` button behaviour instead.\n\nMouse clicks work exactly as before, and I didn't touch any other code.",
